# Sandbender Scavengers (1/1 with no counter): "return target creature card with mana value less than or equal to this creature's power". Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it and Bot1 exiles it. Memnite (mana
# value 0) is the only legal target: Grizzly Bears (mana value 2 > power 1) is not, so Memnite is chosen for Bot1 (a prompt would be left unanswered if the Bears were legal) and returns, the Bears staying in the graveyard.

